   "from": 1,
   "text": "a(n) = A005736(n) + A005640(n+1). - _Sean A. Irvine_, Jul 21 2016"
  },
  {
   "aid": "A007243",
   "from": 1,
   "text": "a(n) = A030197(n) = A045480(n) unless n = 0."
  },
  {
   "aid": "A008391",
   "from": 9,
   "text": "a(n) = 8*a(n-1) - 28*a(n-2) + 56*a(n-3) - 70*a(n-4) + 56*a(n-5) - 28*a(n-6) + 8*a(n-7) - a(n-8). - _Harvey P. Dale_, Mar 04 2012"
  },
  {
